• What is the expected number of lifecycle loops for this product?
• Which components are most likely to degrade and need replacement during remanufacturing?
• Is the product architecture designed to facilitate disassembly, cleaning, inspection, and reassembly?
• What quality standards must the remanufactured product meet to be equivalent to new?
• How will the reverse supply chain be structured to collect used products?
• What is the cost-benefit ratio of remanufacturing versus manufacturing new?